key: idx_city	         ✅ DBMS ne idx_city use kiya.
rows: 50000	             ⚠️ Optimizer estimate kar raha hai ki approximately 50,000 rows examine/scan karni pad sakti hain.
                           → Ye actual rows nahi, sirf estimated rows hain.
                           → Actual execution mein kitni rows examine hui, ye dekhne ke liye EXPLAIN ANALYZE use kar sakte hain.
rows: 20	             ✅ Kam rows scan hongi — fast
