#14. HOW SPRING DATA JPA, HIBERNATE, JDBC, AND JDBC DRIVER WORK TOGETHER
============================================================================

1: SPRING DATA JPA:
--------------------
- JPA ek specification hai (rules ka set).
- Spring Data JPA ek Spring module hai jo JPA ke upar abstraction deta hai jisse relational DB ke saath kaam karna easy banata hai. 
