#15. DB CONNECTION POOL KYA HAI ?
====================================

Application har DB operation ke liye naya physical connection create nahi karti.
Kyunki DB connection create karna expensive hota hai.

Isliye application connection pool se ek existing connection borrow karti hai,
use karti hai, aur kaam ke baad pool ko wapas return kar deti hai


## QUESTION : DATASOUCE AND HIKARI CP KYA HAI ?
-------------------------------------------------

Spring Boot me DataSource ek interface hai, aur uska default
implementation HikariCP hota hai isliye commonly HikariCP ko
connection pool ke roop me use kiya jata hai.

Agar tumne application.properties me kuch explicitly mention nahi kiya,
lekin classpath me HikariCP present hai (kyunki spring-boot-starter-data-jpa
ya spring-boot-starter-jdbc ke saath wo automatically aa jata hai),
to Spring Boot automatically HikariCP ko as DataSource implementation
configure kar deta hai.

Agar classpath me multiple connection pools hain, to Spring Boot
is priority order me choose karta hai:

    1. HikariCP           (sabse pehle)
    2. Tomcat JDBC Pool
    3. Apache Commons DBCP2
    4. Oracle UCP

HikariCP ka kaam sirf database connections store karna nahi hai.
Wo unhe manage bhi karta hai —

- Check karna ki connection abhi bhi zinda hai ya nahi
  Matlab connection database se baat kar sakta hai ya beech me toot gaya hai.
  Agar connection dead mila, to HikariCP usse hata kar naya bana deta hai.

- Kitni der se idle hai
  Matlab connection kitne time se use nahi hua.
  Agar bahut der se idle hai, to HikariCP usse close kar deta hai,
  taaki pool me faltu connections na pade rahein.

- Connection leak hua hai ya nahi
  Matlab koi connection borrow karke wapas return nahi kar raha —
  jaise developer ne connection close karna bhool gaya,
  finally block me connection.close() nahi likha,
  jisse pool ke connections dheere-dheere khatam ho jaate hain.
  HikariCP leak-detection-threshold ke through warning log print karta hai.

- Connection timeout
  Matlab agar pool me saare connections busy hain,
  to naya request kitni der wait karega.
  Agar timeout ke andar connection nahi mila,
  to error aata hai: "Connection is not available, request timed out."

Isse pool hamesha healthy aur efficient bana rehta hai.


## IMPORTANT :
----------------
Connection pool thread-safe hota hai — multiple threads simultaneously
connections borrow kar sakte hain, but ek connection ek time par
sirf ek hi thread ko milta hai.


## QUESTION : JAB APPLICATION START HOTI HAI TO DATABASE CONNECTION POOL KE SAATH KYA HOTA HAI ?
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    1. Spring Boot application start hoti hai.

    2. Spring Boot datasource configuration read karta hai.

       Example:

            DB URL = jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/mydb
            username = root
            password = secret123
            driver class =  com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver
            maximum pool size = 10
            minimum idle connections = 2

    3. HikariCP connection pool initialize hota hai.

    4. HikariCP database ke saath kuch initial connections create karta hai.

       Example:

            minimum-idle       = 2
            maximum-pool-size  = 10

       Iska matlab:
            Application start ke time pool me 2 idle database connections ready honge, jisse application se aane wali DB request borrow kar sakti hai.
            Need padne par pool total 10 database connections tak grow kar sakta hai.

       ### NOTE :
      
            HikariCP me by default minimum-idle ki value
            maximum-pool-size ke barabar hoti hai.

            Matlab agar tum minimum-idle explicitly set na karo,
            to application start hote hi pool maximum database 
            connections tak create kar sakta hai.


## BENEFITS:
-------------

    - Faster DB access, kyunki har DB operation ke liye
      naya DB connection create nahi karna padta

    - Existing DB connections reuse hote hain

    - Controlled number of DB connections,
      jisse DB overload prevent hota hai

    - Application performance improve hoti hai




